 ## Operating characteristics
-- **Performance**: The method runs at roughly half the framerate of geometry instancing. Geometry instancing offers 60fps for 800k kernels and 3fps for 10M kernels on a GeForce 980. The improved OIT method runs at ~1.5 fps for ~400k impulses and between 5 and 60+ fps depending on kernel density and viewpoint [S1, unofficial].
